sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Staff
    participant POS_UI as POS Client (/staff/pos): Boundary
    participant StaffShowtimeCtrl as StaffShowtimeController: Controller
    participant ShowtimeCtrl as ShowtimeController: Controller
    participant StaffProductCtrl as StaffProductController: Controller
    participant PosCtrl as PosStaffController: Controller
    participant StaffShowtimeQuerySvc as StaffShowtimeQueryService: Service
    participant SeatShowtimeQuerySvc as SeatShowtimeQueryService: Service
    participant ProductSvc as ProductService: Service
    participant PosSvc as PosOrderService: Service
    participant ShowtimeBookingSvc as ShowtimeBookingService: Service
    participant Prisma as PrismaService: Repository
    participant Database

    Note over Staff, Database: Step 1: Select Showtime & Seats
    Staff ->>+ POS_UI: Browse branch showtimes
    POS_UI ->>+ StaffShowtimeCtrl: GET /staff/showtimes/today
    StaffShowtimeCtrl ->>+ StaffShowtimeQuerySvc: getStaffTodayShowtimes(staffUserId)
    StaffShowtimeQuerySvc ->>+ Prisma: showtime.findMany(roomId in roomIds, startTime)
    Prisma ->>+ Database: SELECT * FROM showtimes
    Database -->>- Prisma: showtime rows
    Prisma -->>- StaffShowtimeQuerySvc: showtimes
    StaffShowtimeQuerySvc -->>- StaffShowtimeCtrl: StaffShowtimeItemResDto[]
    StaffShowtimeCtrl -->>- POS_UI: 200 OK (StaffShowtimeItemResDto[])

    Staff ->> POS_UI: Select showtime
    POS_UI ->>+ ShowtimeCtrl: GET /showtimes/:id/seats
    ShowtimeCtrl ->>+ SeatShowtimeQuerySvc: getShowtimeSeats(showtimeId)
    SeatShowtimeQuerySvc ->>+ Prisma: seatShowtime.findMany(showtimeId, include: seat)
    Prisma ->>+ Database: SELECT * FROM seat_showtimes JOIN seats
    Database -->>- Prisma: seat_showtime rows
    Prisma -->>- SeatShowtimeQuerySvc: seatShowtimes
    SeatShowtimeQuerySvc -->>- ShowtimeCtrl: SeatShowtimeResDto[]
    ShowtimeCtrl -->>- POS_UI: 200 OK (SeatShowtimeResDto[])
    Staff ->> POS_UI: Select available seats (seatShowtimeIds)

    Note over Staff, Database: Step 2: Select Food & Beverages
    POS_UI ->>+ StaffProductCtrl: GET /staff/products
    StaffProductCtrl ->>+ ProductSvc: getBranchConcessions(branchId)
    ProductSvc ->>+ Prisma: item.findMany(branchId) & combo.findMany(branchId)
    Prisma ->>+ Database: SELECT * FROM items, combos
    Database -->>- Prisma: item & combo rows
    Prisma -->>- ProductSvc: items, combos
    ProductSvc -->>- StaffProductCtrl: BranchConcessionCatalogRes
    StaffProductCtrl -->>- POS_UI: 200 OK (BranchConcessionCatalogRes)
    Staff ->> POS_UI: Select combos & F&B items

    Note over Staff, Database: Step 3: Create Order & Hold Seats
    Staff ->> POS_UI: Submit order creation
    POS_UI ->>+ PosCtrl: POST /staff/pos/orders (CreatePosOrderReq)
    PosCtrl ->>+ PosSvc: createPosBookingOrder(staffContext, body)

    PosSvc ->>+ ShowtimeBookingSvc: reserveSeats(seatShowtimeIds)
    ShowtimeBookingSvc ->>+ Prisma: seatShowtime.updateMany(seatStatus: RESERVED)
    Prisma ->>+ Database: UPDATE seat_showtimes SET seat_status = 'RESERVED'
    Database -->>- Prisma: updated rows count
    Prisma -->>- ShowtimeBookingSvc: updateResult
    ShowtimeBookingSvc -->>- PosSvc: SeatBookingDetail[]

    PosSvc ->>+ Prisma: order.create(Order, SeatOrder[], ProductOrder[])
    Prisma ->>+ Database: INSERT INTO orders, seat_orders, product_orders
    Database -->>- Prisma: created order record (orderId)
    Prisma -->>- PosSvc: Order (orderId)

    PosSvc -->>- PosCtrl: PosBookingSummaryRes (orderId, totalAmount, expiresAt)
    PosCtrl -->>- POS_UI: 201 Created (PosBookingSummaryRes)
    POS_UI -->>- Staff: Display order summary & action options

    Note over Staff, Database: Step 4: Confirm or Cancel Order
    alt Customer Confirms Order
        Staff ->>+ POS_UI: Confirm order and proceed
        POS_UI -->>- Staff: Order status: PENDING -> Proceed to Stage 2 (Counter Payment)
    else Customer Cancels / Abandons Order
        Staff ->>+ POS_UI: Click "Cancel Order"
        POS_UI ->>+ PosCtrl: POST /staff/pos/orders/:orderId/cancel (CancelPosOrderReq)
        PosCtrl ->>+ PosSvc: cancelPosOrder(staffContext, orderId, body)

        PosSvc ->>+ Prisma: order.update(id: orderId, status: CANCELLED)
        Prisma ->>+ Database: UPDATE orders SET status = 'CANCELLED'
        Database -->>- Prisma: updated order row
        Prisma -->>- PosSvc: updated order

        PosSvc ->>+ ShowtimeBookingSvc: releaseSeats(seatShowtimeIds)
        ShowtimeBookingSvc ->>+ Prisma: seatShowtime.updateMany(seatStatus: EMPTY)
        Prisma ->>+ Database: UPDATE seat_showtimes SET seat_status = 'EMPTY'
        Database -->>- Prisma: updated rows count
        Prisma -->>- ShowtimeBookingSvc: released count
        ShowtimeBookingSvc -->>- PosSvc: number of seats released

        PosSvc -->>- PosCtrl: { success: true, message }
        PosCtrl -->>- POS_UI: 200 OK ({ success: true, message })
        POS_UI -->>- Staff: Order cancelled, seats released to EMPTY
    end
